## Executive Summary

This index catalogs all research programs, their authorized sub-programs, and their manufacturing warrants. Each entry is cryptographically sealed against the research law ontology.

**Total Programs:** {{ total_programs }}
**Total Sub-Programs:** {{ total_sub_programs }}
**Total Workflows:** {{ total_workflows }}
**Total Subagent Roles:** {{ total_subagent_roles }}
**Total Skills:** {{ total_skills }}
**Total Hook Policies:** {{ total_hook_policies }}
**Total Checkpoints:** {{ total_checkpoints }}

